&TRACE OFF
***********************************************************************
*                                                                     *
*     DRIVER EXEC TO CALL STORAGE MODULE.  IN ORDER TO EXIT, TYPE     *
*     '*' AND HIT ENTER.  IF YOU DO NOT HAVE IPF 'WAKEUP', STORAGE    *
*     MAY BE CALLED DIRECTLY.                                         *
*                                HENRY NUSSBACHER - 1983              *
***********************************************************************
-TOP
CLRSCRN
STORAGE
SET CMSTYPE HT
WAKEUP AT +00:01
&SAVERC = &RC
SET CMSTYPE RT
&IF &SAVERC = 6 &EXIT
&GOTO -TOP
